## بخش ۶: اسکیمای فایل `content/{slug}.json`

```json
{
  "title": "",
  "h1": "",
  "slug": "",
  "meta_description": "",
  "focus_keyword": "",
  "secondary_keywords": [],
  "search_intent": "informational | commercial | transactional | navigational",
  "estimated_reading_time_min": 0,
  "word_count": 0,
  "toc": [{ "level": 2, "text": "", "anchor": "" }],
  "featured_snippet": "",
  "intro_html": "",
  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "",
      "anchor": "",
      "content_html": "",
      "subsections": [{ "h3": "", "content_html": "" }]
    }
  ],
  "faq": [{ "question": "", "answer": "" }],
  "conclusion_html": "",
  "cta": "",
  "internal_link_suggestions": [{ "anchor_text": "", "target_topic": "" }],
  "external_links": [{ "anchor_text": "", "url": "", "reason": "" }],
  "image_suggestions": [{ "placement": "", "alt_text": "", "generation_prompt": "" }],
  "body_html": "",
  "schema_jsonld": {},
  "faq_schema_jsonld": {},
  "self_check": {
    "keyword_density_percent": 0,
    "banned_phrases_found": [],
    "half_space_applied": true,
    "heading_hierarchy_valid": true,
    "sentence_length_variance_ok": true,
    "bullet_ratio_percent": 0
  }
}
```

**قواعد HTML:** فقط تگ‌های `h2, h3, p, ul, ol, li, strong, em, a, table, thead, tbody, tr, th, td, blockquote`. بدون inline style، بدون class، بدون `dir` یا `lang`.

